  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INE Common Fund 2016-2019 - INE Gender Statistics</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Statistikmyndigheten INE 2016-2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to the statistics agency INE in Mozambique, through a Common fund, together with other donors. Also targeted support for gender statistics as well as a special focus on results-based management, through a planned procurement of services in relation to the planning unit at INE.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till statistikbyr&#xe5;n INE i Mocambique, med m&#xe5;l att &#xf6;ka m&#xf6;jligheter till samh&#xe4;llsplanering och demokratiskt deltagande. Insatsen inneh&#xe5;ller &#xe4;ven en &#xf6;ronm&#xe4;rkt, strategisk komponent f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra statistisk rapportering om j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the intervention is to contribute to a democratic development, to participation, enlightened debate, well grounded research and policy planning and follow up of development policies by furnishing Mozambican general public and institutions, as well as international community with quality statistics.</narrative>
  </description>
